          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: તાલીમ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તાલીમ — tālīm — \"training\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે સારી તાલીમ લેશો તો તમે ઝડપી દોડી શકશો. jo tame sārī tālīm leśo to tame jhaḍpī doḍī śakśo. If you get good training, you'll be able to run fast."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તાલીમ (tālīm) is usually traced to Arabic taʿlīm, \"teaching, instruction\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
